  "description": "By day, Yubin is admired by everyone for his clean image and flawless work performance. But at night, he becomes a completely different person, turning on his webcam alone in his room. As he continues his secret activities while keeping his private life hidden, a fateful and ill-omened connection flutters into his life like a butterfly.\n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=170269), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/120040236), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/Akyeon_n_e), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/bad_butterflyeffect), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_effect_wz), [Qtoon](https://www.qtoon.co.kr/toon/list.mg?tcode=wv9r), MeToon",
